-- before anyone connects
nothing in 30 ms, and the wait took its time: yes
nothing at a look: yes
watching for neither reading nor writing is InvalidInput: yes
-- three clients connect and write
each wait reported the listener, readable, under its token: yes
-- the server reads what is ready and answers
unread bytes are reported by the next wait too: yes
every connection gave its eight bytes: yes
no other socket was reported: yes
once read, nothing is ready: yes
